      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EMPIRE RULER (4) has improved at each of three runs this prep and should be peaking now. Closed well to be beaten half a length last start over 1600m at Balaklava. This slightly longer trip provides a perfect set up. RICH MELODY (6) is deep into the maiden prep but is still going well. Raced on the speed then boxed on well for third last time out over 1500m at this track. Should be hard to hold out. SNOBBERY (7) missed the kick then worked home in good style to get up for fifth when fresh from a spell over 1500m here recently. Placed over the mile when second-up last prep so this looks a nice race for him. CHILLY BRO (3) recorded his first minor placing last start when denied in a photo over 2000m at Murray Bridge. Had a little four-week freshen up after that run so this shorter trip should suit. ATEYATE (1) is a stayer resuming. Today's trip looks nice fit so it will be no surprise if he ran a forward race.",
